{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a 2x2 grid feature section with these EXACT specifications:
    
    CRITICAL RESPONSIVE RULES:
    - Wrapper: width 100%, max-width 100vw, overflow-x hidden
    - All content must stay within viewport - NO horizontal scroll
    - Use box-sizing: border-box everywhere
    
    WRAPPER:
    - Full width, max-width: 100vw
    - Background: white (#FFFFFF)
    - Padding-top: 48px mobile | 72px sm | 96px lg (py-12 sm:py-18 lg:py-24)
    - Padding-bottom: 48px mobile | 72px sm | 96px lg
    - Position: relative
    - Overflow: hidden
    
    INNER CONTAINER:
    - Max-width: 2200px
    - Margin: 0 auto (centered)
    - Padding-horizontal: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 48px lg | 80px xl (px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 xl:px-20)
    - Width: 100%
    - Box-sizing: border-box
    
    MAIN GRID:
    - Display: CSS Grid
    - Grid-template-columns: 1fr (mobile) | repeat(2, 1fr) (xl+)
    - Border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05)
    - Box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25) (shadow-2xl)
    - Overflow: hidden
    
    GRID CELLS (4 total):
    On mobile/tablet (< 1280px): Single column, all 4 cells stack vertically
    On xl (1280px+): 2x2 grid layout
    
    Cell order on mobile:
    1. Cell 1 (Content)
    2. Cell 2 (Hero Image)
    3. Cell 3 (Product Feature)
    4. Cell 4 (CTA Card)
    
    Ensure fully responsive, no horizontal scroll on any device., Add Cell 1 (main content area) to the grid - top-left on desktop, first on mobile:
    
    CELL 1 CONTAINER:
    - Padding: 32px mobile | 48px sm | 80px lg | 96px xl (p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-20 xl:p-24)
    - Display: flex
    - Flex-direction: column
    - Justify-content: center
    - Background: white (#FFFFFF)
    - Border-right: none mobile | 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05) xl
    - Border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05) mobile | none xl
    - Min-height: auto mobile | 500px lg
    - Width: 100%
    - Box-sizing: border-box
    
    LABEL ROW:
    - Display: flex
    - Align-items: center
    - Gap: 12px (gap-3)
    - Margin-bottom: 24px mobile | 32px sm (mb-6 sm:mb-8)
    
    Dot accent:
    - Width: 6px
    - Height: 6px
    - Background: #00B9F1 (cyan-500)
    - Border-radius: 9999px (full circle)
    - Flex-shrink: 0
    
    Label text:
    - Content: "EXHIBITION SYSTEMS"
    - Font-size: 9px mobile | 10px sm
    - Font-weight: 700 (bold)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.3em
    - Color: rgba(0,0,0,0.6)
    - White-space: nowrap, Add heading and description to Cell 1:
    
    MAIN HEADING:
    - Content: "Trade Show Matrix."
    - Font-size: 36px mobile | 48px sm | 56px lg | 64px xl (text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl)
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: -0.02em (tracking-tight)
    - Line-height: 0.85
    - Margin-bottom: 24px mobile | 32px sm (mb-6 sm:mb-8)
    - Color: #000000
    - Word-wrap: break-word
    - Overflow-wrap: break-word
    
    Structure:
    - "Trade Show" = black (#000000)
    - "Matrix." = rgba(0,0,0,0.1) (very faint, 10% opacity)
    
    DESCRIPTION PARAGRAPH:
    - Content: "Modular frameworks engineered for rapid deployment. We build environments that convert."
    - Font-size: 16px mobile | 18px sm (text-base sm:text-lg)
    - Color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5)
    - Font-weight: 300 (light)
    - Line-height: 1.625 (relaxed)
    - Max-width: 100% mobile | 448px sm (max-w-full sm:max-w-md)
    - Margin-bottom: 32px mobile | 48px sm (mb-8 sm:mb-12), Add statistics row to Cell 1:
    
    FEATURES ROW CONTAINER:
    - Display: flex
    - Flex-direction: row
    - Gap: 32px mobile | 48px sm | 64px lg (gap-8 sm:gap-12 lg:gap-16)
    - Margin-bottom: 32px mobile | 48px sm (mb-8 sm:mb-12)
    - Flex-wrap: wrap
    
    FEATURE ITEM (2 total):
    
    Feature 1 - "100% Tool-Free":
    Number:
    - Content: "100%"
    - Font-size: 24px mobile | 28px sm | 30px lg (text-2xl sm:text-3xl)
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Color: #000000
    - Letter-spacing: -0.02em (tight)
    - Line-height: 1
    
    Label:
    - Content: "TOOL-FREE"
    - Font-size: 8px mobile | 9px sm
    - Font-weight: 700 (bold)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.2em
    - Color: rgba(0,0,0,0.4)
    - Margin-top: 4px (mt-1)
    
    Feature 2 - "48H Production":
    Number:
    - Content: "48H"
    - Same styling as Feature 1
    
    Label:
    - Content: "PRODUCTION"
    - Same styling as Feature 1, Add CTA button to Cell 1:
    
    BUTTON CONTAINER:
    - Display: inline-flex
    - Align-items: center
    - Gap: 12px (gap-3)
    - Background: #000000
    - Color: #FFFFFF
    - Padding: 16px 32px mobile | 20px 40px sm (py-4 px-8 sm:py-5 sm:px-10)
    - Font-size: 9px mobile | 10px sm
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.25em
    - Border: none
    - Box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.04) (shadow-xl)
    - Cursor: pointer
    - Width: fit-content mobile | max-content
    - White-space: nowrap
    - Transition: all 200ms ease
    
    ARROW ICON:
    - Size: 12px mobile | 14px sm
    - Color: inherit (white)
    - Transition: transform 200ms ease
    
    BUTTON HOVER STATE:
    - Background: #0891B2 (cyan-600)
    - Box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,185,241,0.2)
    - Arrow: transform translateX(4px)
    - Transition: all 200ms ease
    
    Button text: "REQUEST QUOTE" + ArrowRight icon, Add Cell 2 (hero image) - top-right on desktop, second on mobile:
    
    CELL 2 CONTAINER:
    - Position: relative
    - Min-height: 280px mobile | 350px sm | 400px lg (min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[350px] lg:min-h-[400px])
    - Height: auto mobile | 100% xl
    - Overflow: hidden
    - Border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05) mobile | none xl
    - Background: #000000
    - Width: 100%
    
    IMAGE:
    - Position: absolute
    - Inset: 0
    - Width: 100%
    - Height: 100%
    - Object-fit: cover
    - Object-position: center
    
    Default state:
    - Filter: grayscale(100%)
    - Opacity: 0.8 (80%)
    - Transform: scale(1)
    
    Hover state:
    - Filter: grayscale(0%)
    - Opacity: 1 (100%)
    - Transform: scale(1.05)
    - Transition: all 1000ms ease
    
    GRADIENT OVERLAY:
    - Position: absolute
    - Inset: 0
    - Background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, transparent 50%, transparent 100%)
    - Pointer-events: none
    - Z-index: 1, Add label badge to Cell 2 (bottom-left corner):
    
    BADGE CONTAINER:
    - Position: absolute
    - Bottom: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (bottom-4 sm:bottom-6 lg:bottom-8)
    - Left: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (left-4 sm:left-6 lg:left-8)
    - Display: flex
    - Align-items: center
    - Gap: 8px (gap-2)
    - Z-index: 10
    
    PULSING DOT:
    - Width: 6px mobile | 8px sm (w-1.5 sm:w-2)
    - Height: 6px mobile | 8px sm (h-1.5 sm:h-2)
    - Background: #00B9F1 (cyan-500)
    - Border-radius: 9999px (full)
    - Animation: pulse 2s infinite
    
    Pulse animation keyframes:
    - 0%, 100%: opacity 1, scale 1
    - 50%: opacity 0.5, scale 1.1
    
    BADGE TEXT:
    - Content: "ENTERPRISE CONFIG"
    - Color: #FFFFFF
    - Font-size: 8px mobile | 9px sm
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.2em
    - White-space: nowrap, Add Cell 3 (product feature) - bottom-left on desktop, third on mobile:
    
    CELL 3 CONTAINER:
    - Position: relative
    - Aspect-ratio: 4/3 mobile | 16/10 sm | 16/9 xl
    - Border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05)
    - Border-right: none mobile | 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05) xl
    - Background: #F4F4F5 (zinc-50)
    - Overflow: hidden
    - Cursor: pointer
    - Width: 100%
    
    PRODUCT TAG (top-left):
    - Position: absolute
    - Top: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (top-4 sm:top-6 lg:top-8)
    - Left: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (left-4 sm:left-6 lg:left-8)
    - Background: #000000
    - Color: #FFFFFF
    - Padding: 6px 10px mobile | 6px 12px sm (py-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3)
    - Font-size: 8px mobile | 9px sm
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: 0.1em
    - Z-index: 10
    - Box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)
    - Content: "10x10 KIT"
    
    BACKGROUND IMAGE:
    - Position: absolute
    - Inset: 0
    - Width: 100%
    - Height: 100%
    - Object-fit: cover
    - Mix-blend-mode: multiply
    
    Default state:
    - Opacity: 0.2 (20%)
    - Transform: scale(1)
    
    Hover state:
    - Opacity: 0.4 (40%)
    - Transform: scale(1.1)
    - Transition: all 700ms ease
    
    PRODUCT TITLE (bottom-left):
    - Position: absolute
    - Bottom: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (bottom-4 sm:bottom-6 lg:bottom-8)
    - Left: 16px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (left-4 sm:left-6 lg:left-8)
    - Z-index: 10
    - Content: "POP-UP DISPLAY"
    - Font-size: 24px mobile | 28px sm | 30px lg (text-2xl sm:text-3xl)
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: -0.02em (tight)
    - Color: #000000, Add Cell 4 (CTA card) - bottom-right on desktop, fourth on mobile:
    
    CELL 4 CONTAINER:
    - Aspect-ratio: 4/3 mobile | auto xl
    - Min-height: auto mobile | 280px xl
    - Padding: 32px mobile | 48px sm | 64px lg | 96px xl (p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 xl:p-24)
    - Display: flex
    - Flex-direction: column
    - Align-items: center
    - Justify-content: center
    - Text-align: center
    - Background: #FFFFFF
    - Cursor: pointer
    - Position: relative
    - Overflow: hidden
    - Transition: background 300ms ease
    - Width: 100%
    - Box-sizing: border-box
    
    Hover state:
    - Background: #F4F4F5 (zinc-50)
    
    HOVER DECORATION (cyan slide-up):
    - Position: absolute
    - Inset: 0
    - Background: rgba(0,185,241,0.05) (cyan 5%)
    - Z-index: 0
    
    Default state:
    - Transform: translateY(100%)
    
    Hover state:
    - Transform: translateY(0)
    - Transition: transform 500ms ease, Add content to Cell 4:
    
    CONTENT WRAPPER:
    - Position: relative
    - Z-index: 10
    - Display: flex
    - Flex-direction: column
    - Align-items: center
    
    ICON BOX:
    - Width: 64px mobile | 80px sm | 96px lg (w-16 sm:w-20 lg:w-24)
    - Height: 64px mobile | 80px sm | 96px lg (h-16 sm:h-20 lg:h-24)
    - Margin-bottom: 20px mobile | 24px sm | 32px lg (mb-5 sm:mb-6 lg:mb-8)
    - Border: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05)
    - Border-radius: 16px (rounded-2xl)
    - Display: flex
    - Align-items: center
    - Justify-content: center
    - Background: #FFFFFF
    - Box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) (shadow-sm)
    - Transition: border-color 500ms ease
    
    Hover state:
    - Border-color: #000000
    
    ICON:
    - Size: 24px mobile | 28px sm | 32px lg
    - Stroke-width: 1
    - Color: #000000
    - Type: Layers or Stack icon
    
    TITLE:
    - Content: "CUSTOM FABRICATION"
    - Font-size: 24px mobile | 28px sm | 30px lg (text-2xl sm:text-3xl)
    - Font-weight: 900 (black)
    - Text-transform: uppercase
    - Letter-spacing: -0.02em (tight)
    - Line-height: 1.1
    - Color: #000000
    - Text-align: center
    - Word-wrap: break-word, Add settings to customize this section:
    
    Allow editing:
    - Label text
    - Heading line 1
    - Heading line 2
    - Description text
    - Stat 1 number and label
    - Stat 2 number and label
    - Button text
    - Button link
    - Hero image
    - Badge text
    - Product image
    - Product tag text
    - Product title
    - Cell 4 title
    - Cell 4 link
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-feature-grid-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100vw;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: 72px;
      padding-bottom: 72px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: 96px;
      padding-bottom: 96px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 2200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 48px;
      padding-right: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 80px;
      padding-right: 80px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 80px;
      min-height: 500px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 96px;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      border-bottom: none;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-label-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-label-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    border-radius: 9999px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-label-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-label-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 0.85;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    word-wrap: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 56px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 64px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-heading-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_primary_color }};
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-heading-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_secondary_color }};
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.625;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 448px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_number_color }};
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    padding: 16px 32px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    border: none;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    cursor: pointer;
    width: fit-content;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 200ms ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px 40px;
      font-size: 10px;
      width: max-content;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 185, 241, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    transition: transform 200ms ease;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-feature-grid-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 280px;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000000;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 350px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 400px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 100%;
      border-bottom: none;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    opacity: 0.8;
    transform: scale(1);
    transition: all 1000ms ease;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover img {
    filter: grayscale(0%);
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-image-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 0%, transparent 50%, transparent 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cell-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 32px;
      left: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-badge-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: {{ block.settings.badge_dot_color }};
    border-radius: 9999px;
    animation: ai-feature-grid-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s infinite;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-badge-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-feature-grid-pulse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.5;
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-badge-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-badge-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    background: {{ block.settings.product_bg_color }};
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-product-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    background: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    z-index: 10;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 24px;
      left: 24px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 32px;
      left: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-product-bg-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: 0.2;
    transform: scale(1);
    transition: all 700ms ease;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-feature-grid-product-bg-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 0.4;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    z-index: 10;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 24px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 32px;
      left: 32px;
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: background 300ms ease;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 64px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: auto;
      min-height: 280px;
      padding: 96px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: #F4F4F5;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-decoration-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 185, 241, 0.05);
    z-index: 0;
    transform: translateY(100%);
    transition: transform 500ms ease;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-feature-grid-cta-decoration-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: border-color 500ms ease;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke-width: 1;
    color: #000000;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }
  }

  .ai-feature-grid-cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_title_color }};
    text-align: center;
    word-wrap: break-word;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-feature-grid-cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-feature-grid-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-feature-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-feature-grid-main-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      
      <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-feature-grid-label-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
            <span class="ai-feature-grid-label-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell1_label }}</span>
          </div>
          
          {% if block.settings.cell1_heading_part1 != blank or block.settings.cell1_heading_part2 != blank %}
            <h2 class="ai-feature-grid-cell-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-feature-grid-heading-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell1_heading_part1 }}</span>
              <span class="ai-feature-grid-heading-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell1_heading_part2 }}</span>
            </h2>
          {% endif %}
          
          {% if block.settings.cell1_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-feature-grid-cell-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell1_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-feature-grid-stats-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat1_number }}</div>
              <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat1_label }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat2_number }}</div>
              <div class="ai-feature-grid-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.stat2_label }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          {% if block.settings.cell1_button_text != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.cell1_button_link }}" class="ai-feature-grid-cell-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.cell1_button_text }}
              <svg class="ai-feature-grid-button-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.cell2_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.cell2_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.cell2_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.cell2_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.cell2_image.height }}"
            >
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-image-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
          
          {% if block.settings.cell2_badge_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-feature-grid-badge-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              <span class="ai-feature-grid-badge-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell2_badge_text }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-feature-grid-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.cell3_tag != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-product-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell3_tag }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          
          {% if block.settings.cell3_bg_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.cell3_bg_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.cell3_bg_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              class="ai-feature-grid-product-bg-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.cell3_bg_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.cell3_bg_image.height }}"
            >
          {% endif %}
          
          {% if block.settings.cell3_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-feature-grid-product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell3_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-feature-grid-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.cell4_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.cell4_link }}" class="ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-feature-grid-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% endif %}
          <div class="ai-feature-grid-cta-decoration-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
          <div class="ai-feature-grid-cta-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg class="ai-feature-grid-cta-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="1" ry="1"></rect>
              </svg>
            </div>
            {% if block.settings.cell4_title != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-feature-grid-cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cell4_title }}</h3>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% if block.settings.cell4_link != blank %}
          </a>
        {% else %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Feature grid 2x2",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "General"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
